solution:
Label the vertices $A$, $B$, $C$, and $D$ as shown, and let $x = AC$.

[asy]
draw((0,0)--(5,5)--(12,1)--(7,-8)--cycle,linewidth(0.7));
draw((0,0)--(12,1),dashed);
label("8",(2.5,2.5),NW);
label("10",(8.5,3),NE);
